OL,3,GNEWSAInjunction halts unauthorised work
OL,4,Aat wildlife spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court injunction has been
OL,7,Fsecured to halt the unauthorised use of
OL,8,Fdiggers ripping up a wildlife hotspot.
OL,10,FConstruction vehicles gained access to
OL,11,Fthe floodplain off Sheering Mill Lane
OL,12,Fin Sawbridgeworth on Saturday morning.
OL,14,FPictures seen by the BBC showed at
OL,15,Fleast three diggers tearing the field
OL,16,Fapart, while vans and heavy trucks were
OL,17,Fparked nearby.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
