OL,3,GNEWSAInjunction halts unauthorised work
OL,4,Aat wildlife spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Hertfordshire District Council,
OL,7,Fwhich had shut its offices for the Bank
OL,8,FHoliday weekend just hours earlier,
OL,9,Fsaid work was ordered to stop at about
OL,10,F22:30 BST.
